Package: kalinka-renderer
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Dmitry Savin <envelsavinds@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/madenvel/KalinkaPlayer
Depends: @SHLIBDEPS@
Description: Kalinka Music Player (renderer)
 Network audio renderer for the Kalinka Music Player. Discovers a Kalinka
 server over mDNS, accepts a playback session and plays audio through the
 local ALSA device.
